    "detailed_description": "The main goal is to send a ship with resources at the other island. You will unlock new zones, strategize and manage their resources effectively to send the ship and complete their journey.<br><br>Each zone features unique buildings that can be purchased. During gameplay you will craft more complex items by combining the objects produced by the buildings.<br><br>The game offers a unique blend of idle and crafting elements, making it an exciting and challenging experience. With its beautifully 3D graphics and immersive medieval setting, <strong>Idlenetics</strong> is sure to be a hit with fans of idle and crafting games alike!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2296790/extras/e3638092764cf8b7a2dbb552a2aa6940.avif?t=1675931799\" /></span>",
